00:07:20.361 --> 00:07:21.729
KAVANAUGH AND HIS FAMILY.

00:07:21.262 --> 00:07:23.164
THEY WON'T.

00:07:21.862 --> 00:07:24.098
THEY WILL ACCELERATE.

00:07:23.297 --> 00:07:24.932
WHY WOULDN'T THEY?

00:07:24.231 --> 00:07:26.133
IT'S WORKING.

00:07:25.066 --> 00:07:28.302
BUT THERE IS A COST.

00:07:26.267 --> 00:07:29.670
ESPECIALLY FOR REPUBLICANS.

00:07:28.436 --> 00:07:31.605
AT THIS POINT KAVANAUGH ISN'T

00:07:29.804 --> 00:07:33.374
JUST A SUPREME COURT NOMINEE.

00:07:31.739 --> 00:07:34.008
HE IS A FOLK HERO TO MANY

00:07:33.507 --> 00:07:36.644
PEOPLE.

00:07:34.141 --> 00:07:38.512
INSPIRATION TO MILLIONS.

00:07:36.777 --> 00:07:40.081
PEOPLE WHO SPENT THE LAST TWO

00:07:38.646 --> 00:07:43.050
YEARS BEING BROWBEATEN AND

00:07:40.214 --> 00:07:46.053
BULLIED BY THE MORAL

00:07:43.184 --> 00:07:47.555
INFOREYOURS WERE BUOYED --

00:07:46.187 --> 00:07:48.189
INFERIORS WERE BUOYED BY WHAT

00:07:47.688 --> 00:07:49.890
HE SAID YESTERDAY.

00:07:48.322 --> 00:07:51.192
THEY ARE UNFAIRLY MALIGNED

00:07:50.024 --> 00:07:52.994
BECAUSE THEY IN THE WAY OF

00:07:51.325 --> 00:07:54.061
OTHER PEOPLE GAINING POWER AND

00:07:53.127 --> 00:07:55.363
HAVE BEEN COMMANDED TO SHUT UP

00:07:54.195 --> 00:07:56.197
AND OBEY.

00:07:55.496 --> 00:07:57.098
KAVANAUGH STOOD UP FOR THE

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:59.367
PEOPLE YESTERDAY AND HE RAISED

00:07:57.231 --> 00:08:00.401
A MIDDLE FINGER TO THE

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:00.968
TORMENTERS AND THEY LOVE HIM

00:08:00.534 --> 00:08:02.303
FOR IT.

00:08:01.102 --> 00:08:03.804
KAVANAUGH IS FAR MORE POPULAR

00:08:02.436 --> 00:08:06.173
WITH THE REPUBLICAN VOTERS

00:08:03.938 --> 00:08:07.008
TONIGHT THAN ANY SINGLE

00:08:06.307 --> 00:08:09.710
REPUBLICAN SENATOR.

00:08:07.141 --> 00:08:11.179
HI IS MORE POPULAR THAN THE

00:08:09.844 --> 00:08:12.914
SENATE AS A WHOLE.

00:08:11.312 --> 00:08:15.249
KAVANAUGH WOULDN'T DESCRIBE IT

